      "AI-assisted social engineering and phishing were part of the reported workflow",
      "flagged implants were systematically revised and redeployed",
      "read-receipt suppression reduced visibility while blocked security updates impeded new detections",
      "bulk export is represented only as a terminal synthetic receipt"
    ],
    "transformed": [
      "all people, organizations, messages, artifacts, identifiers, and services are fictional",
      "every action is a typed local state transition with no code execution or networking",
      "the AI-guided revision is a deterministic fixture transition, not model inference",
      "the scenario ends at a synthetic export/evasion receipt and excludes real intrusion mechanics"
    ],
